#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example reproduces an example from CS 2016 using pedal force input, power boost, thermal effects, and an external ABS controller from Simulink called "Type B."
#
#This version uses the same linked dataset for the brake system as past versions. This dataset is from a legacy library, rather than the more versatile 4W brake system library.
#
#Datasets from the legacy library (Brakes: Four-Wheel System w. Boost and Thermal Effects) still work as intended.
#
#However, links to the external Simulink model must be modified. For the "Type B" model, a change was made to the dataset that lists the variables imported from Simulink. (See the Import dataset for notes about the changes.)
#
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

